 "sentences": [
  "1995 saw unusually quiet hurricane activity.",
  "It was the first season with below average activity since 1979.",
  "Only 11 tropical cyclones formed during the season.",
  "Of those, 7 became hurricanes and 3 were major hurricanes.",
  "Hurricane Ismael was the most notable storm, killing at least 116 people in Mexico.",
  "Hurricane Juliette was the strongest, hitting 150 mph winds but staying away from land."
